1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 18]

34
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:39,860
Come here.

35
00:01:41,150 --> 00:01:41,590
Shandou.

36
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,980
Wait here for me, okay?

37
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:43,250
Okay.

38
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:01,120
Little girl.

39
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:02,510
What are you eating?

40
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,560
Could you

41
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,480
give me one?

42
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:08,030
Thanks.

43
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:22,520
There's one more thing

44
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,710
I need to report.

45
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,560
What is it?

46
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:27,400
These rebels

47
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:28,870
have hideouts everywhere.

48
00:02:29,630 --> 00:02:31,310
The court has sent troops many times,

49
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:33,000
but still can't find their base.

50
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,710
But,

51
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:35,870
I didn't let you down.

52
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,590
I found their base.

53
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:40,680
Perhaps Your Highness could

54
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,120
give me the cure first,

55
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,120
and free me

56
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:47,310
from this Gu inside me.

57
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,150
Then I can

58
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,630
leave at once

59
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:50,870
and capture the rebels.

60
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:52,870
That depends

61
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:55,190
on how useful you are.

62
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:56,910
Your Highness.

63
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:59,030
When I was young,

64
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:00,630
I worked at the Ministry of Works.

65
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,000
One year, there was a severe drought.

66
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,360
While searching for water,

67
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,750
well,

68
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:05,710
I've covered

69
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:08,000
every inch of land

70
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,960
of the capital.

71
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,590
Myrtle berries of this color

72
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:15,590
grow in only

73
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,680
one place.

74
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:17,590
And that's

75
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,750
Shanhua Valley.

76
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,430
Well,

77
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,590
you really do know your stuff.

78
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,400
To serve you,

79
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,470
I'd gladly give my life.

80
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:43,360
Then die.

81
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:46,150
You're nothing but a tool.

82
00:03:46,470 --> 00:03:48,590
How dare you bargain with me?

83
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:49,870
Guards.

84
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,030
Send my order.

85
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,240
The rebels

86
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,190
assassinated Zhu Yi.

87
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,520
They deserve death.

88
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,520
I

89
00:03:58,150 --> 00:03:58,710
hereby order

90
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,080
troops sent at once

91
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,590
to encircle Shanhua Valley.

92
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,030
I want

93
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:04,520
the whole valley

94
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:06,910
razed to the ground.

95
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,590
Yes.

96
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:24,190
Sir.

97
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,160
Something happened in the capital?

98
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,800
Zhu Yi came to me

99
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:29,830
with a lead

100
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,270
on my birth parents

101
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,750
and asked me to spare his life.

102
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:33,870
That's good.

103
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,310
I told you so.

104
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:37,510
I knew you'd find your family.

105
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,830
When the time comes,

106
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,680
take us with you.

107
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,270
We'll find a place to farm

108
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,720
and live a good life all the same.

109
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,390
Chang'an.

110
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:48,000
I have something to handle.

111
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,560
Go back to Shanhua Valley.

112
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:50,750
Sir.

113
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,830
You haven't recovered.

114
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:53,360
Let me handle it instead.

115
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,870
Don't be scared, birdie.

116
00:04:58,830 --> 00:04:59,870
I'll fix you right up

117
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:01,680
and give you two new joints.

118
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,600
Birth details?

119
00:05:13,430 --> 00:05:13,920
Sir.

120
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,560
The Noble Consort gave birth
before entering the palace.

121
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,720
Yun Zhanpeng abandoned the baby
in a mass grave.

122
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,270
On the baby's shoulder

123
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:24,430
was a hibiscus-shaped brand.

124
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,600
Han Jin.

125
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,920
Why meet me here all of a sudden?

126
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,600
Why couldn't we talk in the palace?

127
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,830
Zhao?

128
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,120
It's you.

129
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,480
Next time you want to see me,

130
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,600
come to the palace anytime.

131
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:12,480
I've already given the order.

132
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:13,560
No one will stop you.

133
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,390
You are my mother?

134
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:23,720
You know?

135
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:26,360
When did you find out?

136
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,950
When you were punished at the gate,

137
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:36,950
I saw the mark on your shoulder.

138
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,310
I put it there with...

139
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:44,160
Zhao, are you angry with me?

140
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:47,160
The moment I knew you were my son,

141
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,750
I stopped them

142
00:06:48,750 --> 00:06:49,870
from hitting you again.

143
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:51,920
How are your wounds?

144
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,000
Let me see.

145
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,430
Who's my father?

146
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,160
Han Jin?

147
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,310
What about the Crown Prince?

148
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:13,560
Who did you have him with?

149
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,040
You and Qingyan

150
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,830
are brothers.

151
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,040
You swapped

152
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,120
the Crown Prince

153
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:28,360
with Yun Shao.

154
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:32,160
Han Jin didn't mean to kill the Empress.

155
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,950
It was an accident.

156
00:07:35,630 --> 00:07:36,950
Your Highness.

157
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,870
You really are something.

158
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:46,160
You toyed the royal family for fools.

159
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,800
Even your own sons

160
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:52,430
are pawns in your climb to the throne.

161
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,390
That's not true.

162
00:07:54,390 --> 00:07:55,240
Zhao, listen to me.

163
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:57,000
I never meant to use you.

164
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:59,000
Zhao, listen.

165
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:03,630
The day you were born,

166
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,160
word came that Han Jin was dead.

167
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:10,560
My father forced me into the palace.

168
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,430
I begged them

169
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:16,360
to find you a good home.

170
00:08:17,950 --> 00:08:19,240
But they told me

171
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,510
you'd died.

172
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:25,510
Zhao.

173
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,680
Don't be angry.

174
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,680
I'll make it up to you.

175
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:32,440
Fine.

176
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,480
How will you make it up to me?

177
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:37,360
Tell me.

178
00:08:37,670 --> 00:08:38,600
I'll give you

179
00:08:38,790 --> 00:08:39,790
anything you want.

180
00:08:40,150 --> 00:08:40,840
Fine.

181
00:08:42,550 --> 00:08:43,390
I want

182
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,960
the throne.

183
00:08:57,340 --> 00:09:05,100
[Prince of Xin'an's Residence]

184
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,830
Your Highness, we're here.

185
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:14,460
[Prince of Xin'an's Residence]

186
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,120
This is one of his men.

187
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:27,960
At the border,

188
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:30,360
he already has a ten-year-old son.

189
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:31,960
Are you sure

190
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:34,080
he still wants Qingyan and me

191
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,150
as his sons?

192
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,790
To the Crown Prince's.

193
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,030
Yes.

194
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,720
Let's go.

195
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:50,180
[Prince of Xin'an's Residence]

196
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,150
Mother Consort.

197
00:09:57,500 --> 00:09:58,870
Why come so late?

198
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:00,030
What is it?

199
00:10:01,750 --> 00:10:03,600
Han Jin snuck back four months ago.

200
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,080
His troops

201
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,390
are almost here.

202
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:08,750
There's no need for that.

203
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:10,550
Once Father dies,

204
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:11,870
I'll inherit the throne.

205
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,440
I don't need him anymore.

206
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,440
Qingyan.

207
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,080
What if Han Jin

208
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,630
is planning a rebellion?

209
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,120
A rebellion?

210
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,360
Didn't you say

211
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:29,240
you two were bound

212
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,320
by unshakable love,

213
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,550
and all he did was for me?

214
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,390
Are you mocking me?

215
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,600
I wouldn't dare.

216
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,000
Qingyan.

217
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,080
I only have you and your brother now.

218
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,630
You two need to stand together.

219
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,150
If you trust him that much,

220
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:50,910
then go to him.

221
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,630
Qingyan.

222
00:10:54,270 --> 00:10:55,440
What's with that attitude?

223
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,390
What about you?

224
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,670
For eighteen years,

225
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,910
you never claimed me as your own.

226
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,720
Since I was old enough to understand,

227
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,960
the palace tongues questioned who I was.

228
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,270
Every day,

229
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,000
I live on edge,

230
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,000
unable to sleep,

231
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:17,120
dreading that one day

232
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,590
you'll have a son of your own

233
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,570
and cast me aside.

234
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,750
I care for you with all my heart.

235
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,720
How can you say that?

236
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,790
Care for me?

237
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,600
That was control.

238
00:11:32,390 --> 00:11:34,150
What I ate or drank,

239
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:36,870
everyone I spoke to,

240
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,870
had to follow your will.

241
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,510
One misstep,

242
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,360
and I have failed you.

243
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,080
But with Pei Zhao?

244
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,960
Look at how you acted.

245
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,360
He won't even smile at you.

246
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,150
Yet you act like his lapdog,

247
00:11:51,150 --> 00:11:51,870
wagging your tail at him.

248
00:11:51,870 --> 00:11:52,670
Mind your tongue.

249
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,600
You'd never slap him so.

250
00:12:04,750 --> 00:12:05,840
You'd only say,

251
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,480
"My dear Zhao,

252
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,360
you're so much better than Qingyan."

253
00:12:12,630 --> 00:12:13,440
Qingyan.

254
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,790
Did I just...

255
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:17,870
Mother Consort.

256
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:19,960
I'll take my leave.

257
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,360
Qingyan, answer me.

258
00:12:25,790 --> 00:12:26,720
If Han Jin

259
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,720
turns on his own sons,

260
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,030
what will you do?

261
00:12:33,870 --> 00:12:35,840
You should worry about my brother first.

262
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,960
Han Jin will attack Shanhua Valley.

263
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:40,240
He gave the order himself.

264
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,270
He wants

265
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,270
the whole valley

266
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,150
razed to the ground.

267
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:03,910
You stay here

268
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:04,510
and protect everyone.

269
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,270
I'll draw them away.

270
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,000
Let me.

271
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,270
I know these mountain paths.

272
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Lord Pei still isn't back.

273
00:13:09,270 --> 00:13:09,840
Madam Yun.

274
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:10,750
I'll draw them away.

275
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:11,670
Chang'an, no.

276
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,000
Don't worry.

277
00:13:14,150 --> 00:13:14,790
Those thugs

278
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,630
are no match for me.

279
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,000
Chang'an.

280
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:18,150
Chang'an.

281
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:18,750
Chang'an.

282
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:19,270
Chang'an.

283
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,000
Stop it.

284
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:27,550
- Stop.
- Stop.

285
00:13:27,550 --> 00:13:27,910
Freeze.

286
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:33,960
Ji Chang'an.

287
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:35,870
Shame on you.

288
00:13:41,270 --> 00:13:42,000
Come here.

289
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,080
Guard Ji.

290
00:14:07,790 --> 00:14:08,790
Brother Chang'an.

291
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:11,960
Brother Chang'an.

292
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:14,870
Run.

293
00:14:15,150 --> 00:14:16,080
Whoever runs fastest

294
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,960
gets a reward from me.

